# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for third-party code (tsan preset, ctest).
# Keep each entry as narrow as possible and say why.

# libdatachannel takes its internal synchronized_callback mutexes in different
# orders during connection setup and close (lock-order inversion inside
# rtc::impl, no project frames involved). Reported against 0.24.6.
deadlock:rtc::synchronized_callback
